[15.015476, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.015552, "o", "The theorem states that addition is commutative for natural numbers (forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.015617, "o", "The proof attempt uses induction but is missing some crucial steps.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[15.015655, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[15.01569, "o", "> Your task is to:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.015711, "o", "1. Analyze the incomplete proof in plus_comm.v\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.015756, "o", "2. Add the missing steps to complete the proof\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[15.015768, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.01581, "o", "3. Compile the completed proof using coqc\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[15.015829, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.015978, "o", "The proof should be completed using Coq'\"'\"'s tactics and the final compiled proof should be in plus_comm.vo.' 2>&1 | tee /agent-logs/opencode.log; tmux wait -S done\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
