[24.844039, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[25.686989, "o", "Completed the proof and compiled it successfully.\r\n\r\n**What was missing:**\r\n- **Base case** (`0 + m = m + 0`): after `simpl` the goal is `m = m + 0`, so it needed `rewrite <- plus_n_O` before `reflexivity`.\r\n- **Inductive case**: after `simpl` the goal is `S (n' + m) = m + S n'`. It needed `rewrite <- plus_n_Sm` to turn the right side into `S (m + n')`, then `rewrite IHn'` and `reflexivity`.\r\n\r\nFinal proof in `/workspace/plus_comm.v`:\r\n\r\n```coq\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\n\r\nTheorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\r\n  n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [|n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite <- plus_n_O.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite <- plus_n_Sm.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\nQed.\r\n```\r\n\r\n`coqc plus_comm.v` ran with no errors, producing `/workspace/plus_comm.vo`.\r\n"]
[25.914859, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@9dabba4309ac:/workspace# "]
